WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:04.120
Unit three. Internet Safety Basics!

2
00:00:05.055 --> 00:00:09.376
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:12.562
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:16.912
Today we learn about Internet Safety Basics. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.029 --> 00:00:23.095
Internet. Say it with me. Internet!

6
00:00:26.598 --> 00:00:30.614
Website. Say it with me. Website!

7
00:00:34.056 --> 00:00:37.523
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

8
00:00:41.062 --> 00:00:45.729
Ask an adult. Say it with me. Ask an adult!

9
00:00:49.217 --> 00:00:53.233
Password. Say it with me. Password!

10
00:00:56.705 --> 00:01:00.339
Private. Say it with me. Private!

11
00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:07.609
Stranger. Say it with me. Stranger!

12
00:01:11.088 --> 00:01:14.994
Careful. Say it with me. Careful!

13
00:01:18.526 --> 00:01:32.799
The internet connects computers around the world so I can visit a website. I stay safe online by keeping my password private and being careful with a stranger. I always ask an adult before going somewhere new online.

14
00:01:32.849 --> 00:01:35.893
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:36.598 --> 00:01:42.205
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:42.255 --> 00:01:43.405
Safe!

17
00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:49.802
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.852 --> 00:01:51.030
Stranger!

19
00:01:52.139 --> 00:01:58.560
Did you know? A strong password is like a secret code that keeps your information safe from others!

20
00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:00.817
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:01.941 --> 00:02:11.068
Think and answer. What should you do if you see something confusing online?

22
00:02:11.118 --> 00:02:12.268
Great answer!

23
00:02:13.262 --> 00:02:18.876
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:18.926 --> 00:02:22.102
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

